<title>ESTONIA: MICROLINK TO BE HEWLETT-PACKARD'S RESELLER.</title>
<headline>MICROLINK TO BE HEWLETT-PACKARD'S RESELLER.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microlink, Estonia's largest computer company, said it is to become the official re-seller for Hewlett-Packard printers in Estonia.</p>
<p>Microlink said in statement that it will sign on Monday an agreement making it the official sales agent in Estonia for Hewlet-Packard.</p>
<p>Microlink said that according to research, it was the largest computer company in the Baltic states with 11.7 percent of the total market share.</p>
<p>Microlink's turnover in 1996 was 211.8 million kroons and it has forecast turnover for 1997 of 360 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
